    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever or weight loss</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Burning palate with white patches; no bleeding, lump, nasal leakage or trouble swallowing</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Worried that the cancer has come back; mood otherwise steady</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

